# sciona-atoms

General provider repo for `sciona.atoms.*` and `sciona.probes.*` namespace packages.

Current migrated slices:
- algorithmic: `sciona.atoms.algorithmic.divide_and_conquer`
- state estimation: `sciona.atoms.state_estimation.*`
- inference: `sciona.atoms.inference.advancedvi`

Transitional compatibility copies remain here for signal content until matcher wiring is fully narrowed to `../sciona-atoms-signal`.
